<title>UK: WGZ Bank sets 500 million mark structured bond.</title>
<headline>WGZ Bank sets 500 million mark structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>WGZ Bank said it was lead managing the following structured bond for itself.</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.25	  MATURITY *29.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	   PAY DATE  27.SEP.96</p>
<p> FEES    UNDISCLOSED  LISTING    DUSSELFORF  PAY FREQ  ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) 1</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR ON 29.SEP.97.</p>
<p>		COUPON IN YEAR TWO   --  5.00 PCT.</p>
<p>		COUPON IN YEAR THREE --  6.00 PCT.</p>
<p>		COUPON IN YEAR FOUR  --  7.00 PCT.</p>
<p>		WESTDEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTS-ZENTRALBANK</p>
<p> -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658   CALL AT PAR ON 29.SEP.97.</p>
</text>
